  "final_message": "`shipping.ZONES` in `shipping.py` has 5 keys: `NA-EAST`, `NA-WEST`, `EU-CENTRAL`, `EU-NORTH` and `APAC-SE`. Importing the module and checking `len(shipping.ZONES)` also returns 5.\n\nNone of the other files change the count, as the README says:\n- **`decoy_legacy_zones.py`:** an old zone table kept for reference (`ZONE-A` to `ZONE-D`).\n- **`decoy_partner_regions.py`:** a partner carrier's region names, not zone codes.\n- **`decoy_warehouse_map.py`:** maps warehouses to zones; its values reuse three of the real codes but don't add any.\n- **`checkout.py`:** only calls `fee_for` from `shipping.py`.\n- **`notify.py`:** message templates with no zone data.\n- **`.amplifier/settings.local.yaml`:** empty settings with no zone data.\n\nANSWER: 5",
